---
import MountainIcon from '../icons/MountainIcon.astro';
import SunIcon from '../icons/SunIcon.astro';
import MoonIcon from '../icons/MoonIcon.astro';
import SparklesIcon from '../icons/SparklesIcon.astro';
---

<article class="clima-card">
  <div class="clima-card__header">
    <div class="clima-card__insignia">
      <MountainIcon size={16} class="text-[#D4AF37]" />
      <span class="clima-lugar">Arequipa · 2,325 m s. n. m.</span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="clima-card__titulo">Condiciones para el 12 de Junio</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="clima-metricas">
    <div class="metrica-chip">
      <span class="metrica-chip__icono">
        <SunIcon size={22} class="text-[#FFE58F]" />
      </span>
      <div class="metrica-chip__datos">
        <span class="metrica-chip__temp">22°C</span>
        <span class="metrica-chip__etiqueta">Tarde soleada</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="metrica-chip">
      <span class="metrica-chip__icono">
        <MoonIcon size={20} class="text-[#D4AF37]" />
      </span>
      <div class="metrica-chip__datos">
        <span class="metrica-chip__temp">11°C</span>
        <span class="metrica-chip__etiqueta">Noche fresca</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="metrica-chip">
      <span class="metrica-chip__icono">
        <SparklesIcon size={20} class="text-[#5EEAD4]" />
      </span>
      <div class="metrica-chip__datos">
        <span class="metrica-chip__temp">Cielo Limpio</span>
        <span class="metrica-chip__etiqueta">Vista estelar</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="clima-card__nota">
    Al ser clima seco de altura, recomendamos mantenerte hidratado y traer un saco o estola elegante para la medianoche.
  </p>
</article>

<style>
  .clima-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(27, 42, 74, 0.65) 0%, rgba(11, 29, 58, 0.75) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.35);
    border-radius: var(--radio-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    box-shadow: var(--sombra-suave);
  }

  .clima-card__insignia {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--dorado);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .clima-card__titulo {
    font-family: var(--titulo);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: #FFF6D6;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .clima-metricas {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(110px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .metrica-chip {
    background: rgba(7, 16, 32, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radio-md);
    padding: 0.85rem 0.6rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .metrica-chip__icono {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .metrica-chip__datos {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .metrica-chip__temp {
    font-family: var(--titulo);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--dorado);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .metrica-chip__etiqueta {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--plata);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .clima-card__nota {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--crema);
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
  }
</style>
